# Bilibili negative-path: well-formed JSON missing the follower /
# following keys (e.g. API response shape change). Same shape as
# empty_response.scn; verifies the indexOf guards trip cleanly when
# the body parses but the expected keys are absent.

app bilibili
http_fixture relation/stat bilibili_negative/missing_keys.json

wait_ms 400
assert_no_crash

action UP
wait_ms 400
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
